<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Repeated Retrieval Beats Passive Exposure</title>
<style>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  body {
    width: 1920px;
    height: 1080px;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    position: relative;
    color: #0d1b2a;
  }
  .shell {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 1920px;
    height: 1080px;
    z-index: 10;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .content-layer {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 1920px;
    height: 1080px;
    z-index: 20;
    padding: 120px 140px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  header {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0d1b2a;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .subheader {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #4a5568;
    max-width: 1400px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .subheader sup {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #a0aec0;
    margin-left: 4px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .figure-container {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 140px; /* Keep clear of footer */
  }

  .chart-area {
    width: 1400px;
    height: 450px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .axis-line {
    stroke: #e2e8f0;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .axis-label {
    font-size: 18px;
    fill: #718096;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .curve-passive {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #cbd5e0;
    stroke-width: 4;
    stroke-dasharray: 8 8;
  }

  .curve-active {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #0d1b2a;
    stroke-width: 5;
  }

  .pulse-line {
    stroke: #e53e3e;
    stroke-width: 3;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    fill: #e53e3e;
  }

  .retention-dot {
    fill: #0d1b2a;
  }

  .annotation-text {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: #0d1b2a;
  }

  .annotation-sub {
    font-size: 18px;
    fill: #4a5568;
  }

  .legend {
    position: absolute;
    top: -20px;
    right: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .legend-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #4a5568;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .legend-line {
    width: 40px;
    height: 4px;
  }
  .legend-line.passive {
    background-color: #cbd5e0;
    border-top: 4px dashed #cbd5e0;
    height: 0;
  }
  .legend-line.active {
    background-color: #0d1b2a;
  }

  .callout-box {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -60px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: #f7fafc;
    border-left: 4px solid #3182ce;
    padding: 20px 32px;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #2d3748;
    font-weight: 500;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<img class="shell" src="../../../../templates/saem-annual-meeting-template-v1/template.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />

<div class="content-layer">
  <header>
    <h1>Repeated retrieval beats passive exposure.</h1>
    <div class="subheader">
      Daily questions and spaced review make retention more durable.<sup>[11, 12, 20, 28]</sup>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="figure-container">
    <div class="chart-area">

      <div class="legend">
        <div class="legend-item">
          <div class="legend-line passive"></div>
          Passive Exposure (Single Session)
        </div>
        <div class="legend-item">
          <div class="legend-line active"></div>
          Spaced Retrieval
        </div>
      </div>

      <svg width="1400" height="450" viewBox="0 0 1400 450">
        <!-- Axes -->
        <line x1="50" y1="400" x2="1350" y2="400" class="axis-line" />
        <line x1="50" y1="50" x2="50" y2="400" class="axis-line" />

        <text x="50" y="30" class="axis-label">Retention Level</text>
        <text x="1350" y="430" class="axis-label" text-anchor="end">Time</text>

        <!-- Passive Curve (Ebbinghaus style decay) -->
        <path d="M 50 80 Q 200 380 1300 390" class="curve-passive" />

        <!-- Active Curve (Spaced Repetition) -->
        <!-- Initial learning -->
        <path d="M 50 80 Q 150 250 250 280" class="curve-active" />

        <!-- Pulse 1 -->
        <line x1="250" y1="400" x2="250" y2="120" class="pulse-line" />
        <circle cx="250" cy="120" r="6" class="pulse-dot" />
        <text x="250" y="100" class="annotation-text" text-anchor="middle">Retrieve</text>
        <path d="M 250 120 Q 400 220 550 240" class="curve-active" />

        <!-- Pulse 2 -->
        <line x1="550" y1="400" x2="550" y2="100" class="pulse-line" />
        <circle cx="550" cy="100" r="6" class="pulse-dot" />
        <text x="550" y="80" class="annotation-text" text-anchor="middle">Reactivate</text>
        <path d="M 550 100 Q 750 160 950 170" class="curve-active" />

        <!-- Pulse 3 -->
        <line x1="950" y1="400" x2="950" y2="90" class="pulse-line" />
        <circle cx="950" cy="90" r="6" class="pulse-dot" />
        <text x="950" y="70" class="annotation-text" text-anchor="middle">Retain</text>
        <path d="M 950 90 Q 1150 110 1300 120" class="curve-active" />

        <!-- End points -->
        <circle cx="1300" cy="390" r="8" fill="#cbd5e0" />
        <circle cx="1300" cy="120" r="10" class="retention-dot" />

        <!-- Final Annotation -->
        <text x="1320" y="126" class="annotation-text" fill="#0d1b2a">Durable Knowledge</text>

      </svg>

      <div class="callout-box">
        Each retrieval attempt flattens the forgetting curve.
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
